      "analogy": "An FAA aircraft certification checkride: flight examiners put the aircraft through stall recovery, extreme weather simulations, and engine-out drills, logging telemetry (Confusion Matrix, ROC-AUC, F1, Perplexity, SHAP values) to verify passenger safety.",
      "whyItMatters": "In real-world enterprise architectures, mishandling con\ufb01gure rag system monitoring, including retrieval accuracy assessment. causes severe production incidents: train-serve skew, silent model decay, runaway cloud GPU expenses, or compliance violations during security audits. Mastering this ensures scalable, production-ready machine learning solutions on AWS."
