    "howItWorks": {
      "steps": [
        "Step 1 (Ingest & Setup): Configure data ingestion and source connectivity using SageMaker Real-time Endpoints with least-privilege IAM execution roles.",
        "Step 2 (Security & Isolation): Deploy resources inside private VPC subnets with VPC Endpoints (PrivateLink) and AWS KMS CMK encryption at rest.",
        "Step 3 (Execute Pipeline): Execute the core transformation, training, or deployment job using native AWS managed APIs with automated parameter tuning.",
        "Step 4 (Validation & Governance): Validate output schemas, monitor latency and error metrics in Amazon CloudWatch, and enforce lineage tracking in SageMaker Model Registry.",
        "Step 5 (Automation & Drift): Establish automated alerts, auto-scaling policies, and retraining triggers using Amazon EventBridge."
      ],
      "mechanics": "AWS manages this architecture through private RESTful microservices orchestrated over AWS Nitro network backplanes. Authentication uses AWS Signature Version 4 (SigV4) IAM temporary credentials. Data traffic between compute clusters and storage stays isolated inside your AWS Virtual Private Cloud (VPC) via Gateway and Interface VPC Endpoints, eliminating public internet exposure while maximizing network bandwidth."
    },
    "diagram": "  [ Client Applications / API Gateway Requests ]\n                         \u2502\n                         \u25bc\n  \u250c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2510\n  \u2502 SageMaker Endpoint (VPC Endpoint / PrivateLink)        \u2502\n  \u2502 \u2022 Real-time: Persistent instances, <10ms latency       \u2502\n  \u2502 \u2022 Serverless: Auto-scale to 0, cost effective spiky    \u2502\n  \u2502 \u2022 Asynchronous: S3 queue, up to 1GB payload, 1hr run   \u2502\n  \u2502 \u2022 Multi-Model: Host 100s of models on single instance  \u2502\n  \u2514\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2518\n                           \u2502\n                           \u25bc\n  [ Data Capture to S3 -> CloudWatch Invocations Metrics ]",
