      "Master the core operational principles of 'Con\ufb01gure and troubleshoot AWS CodeBuild, AWS CodeCommit, AWS CodeDeploy, AWS CodePipeline, and AWS CodeConnections.'.",
      "Understand how AWS integrates Amazon SageMaker Pipelines and related services for Task 3.3: Implement automated orchestration and continuous CI/CD pipelines.",
      "Learn the step-by-step technical lifecycle and runtime mechanics of this workflow.",
      "Identify common exam traps, distractors, and golden decision rules to score 1000/1000 on the MLA-C02 exam."
