      "analogy": "A robotic automotive assembly line: chassis arrives, automated arms weld joints (ProcessingStep), engine is installed (TrainingStep), quality laser scans tolerances (ClarifyCheckStep), and only if certified (ConditionStep) is the car registered and driven out of the factory (Model Registry & Blue/Green Deploy).",
      "whyItMatters": "In real-world enterprise architectures, mishandling build and integrate mechanisms to re-train models. causes severe production incidents: train-serve skew, silent model decay, runaway cloud GPU expenses, or compliance violations during security audits. Mastering this ensures scalable, production-ready machine learning solutions on AWS."
