      "summary": "Skill 4.2.3 evaluates your ability to: 'Set up dashboards to monitor performance metrics.'. Within Task 4.2: Optimize and manage ML and AI infrastructure costs and performance under Domain 4: Operating, Monitoring & Securing ML & AI Solutions, this skill ensures that ML workloads maintain data integrity, optimal throughput, low latency, and robust fault-tolerance. As an AWS Machine Learning Engineer, you must know which managed services to select, how they connect, and how to eliminate performance bottlenecks.",
      "analogy": "A smart commercial power grid: running heavy smelting operations during off-peak hours with dynamic spot electricity rates (Managed Spot Training with S3 checkpointing), and automatically throttling idling transformers (Endpoint Auto-Scaling and Compute Optimizer).",
